  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project for Women&apos;s Economic Empowerment in Egypt(UN Women)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A gender-responsive private sector that attracts, retains and invests in women is supported.Engagement at community, government and corporate level to encourage women to enter different occupations (including the non-traditional and male dominated jobs) is increased, provided that jobs are decent, and the horizontal and vertical occupational segregation is eliminated.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Egyptian women are economically empowered by bridging the gap between attaining education and access to decent employment opportunities through; 1) supporting a gender-responsive private sector that attracts, retains and invests in women; and 2) engaging at community, government and corporate level to encourage women to enter different occupations (including the non-traditional and male dominated jobs), provided that jobs are decent, and the horizontal and vertical occupational segregation is eliminated&#x25A3; &#xC774;&#xC9D1;&#xD2B8; &#xB300;&#xC0C1; &#xAD6D;&#xC81C;&#xAE30;&#xAD6C;&#xC640;&#xC758; &#xBA40;&#xD2F0;&#xBC14;&#xC774;&#xC0AC;&#xC5C5; &#xACC4;&#xAE30;, &#xC6B0;&#xB9AC; &#xC778;&#xB825;&#xC758; &#xAD6D;&#xC81C;&#xAE30;&#xAD6C; &#xC9C4;&#xCD9C; &#xAE30;&#xD68C; &#xC81C;&#xACF5;
  - &#xD55C;&#xAD6D;&#xC778; &#xC778;&#xB825; &#xCC44;&#xC6A9;&#xC73C;&#xB85C; &#xD55C;&#xAD6D;&#xC778; &#xC778;&#xC801;&#xC790;&#xC6D0;&#xC758; &#xAC15;&#xD654; &#xBC0F; &#xACF5;&#xB3D9; M &#xD55C;-&#xC774;&#xC9D1;&#xD2B8; &#xAE30;&#xC220;&#xB300;&#xD559; (2016-2022) &#xC0AC;&#xC5C5;&#xC774; &#xC2DC;&#xD589; &#xC911;&#xC778; &#xBCA0;&#xB2C8;&#xC218;&#xC5D0;&#xD504; &#xC8FC;&#xB97C; &#xC0AC;&#xC5C5;&#xC5D0; &#xD3EC;&#xD568;&#xD558;&#xC5EC; &#xC120;&#xD0DD;&#xACFC; &#xC9D1;&#xC911; &#xD6A8;&#xACFC; &#xC81C;&#xACE0; 
